# Extra names blocked on this TV, on top of the LG ad and telemetry list built into watch.sh (hosts_sync, from Glasshouse's ads tier).
# Not shipped in the build: copy it by hand to /var/lib/homehook/hosts-extra. One name per line as "0.0.0.0 <name>" and ":: <name>";
# watch.sh takes nothing else, and keeps them in its block in /etc/hosts; a line taken out here leaves /etc/hosts on the next pass.
# /var/lib/homehook/no-lg-block turns the built-in list off and keeps only these lines.
